# Line endings are pinned to LF.
#
# The build scripts (wordpress/build-paste.js, build-onepage.js,
# sync-from-edealer.js) work by matching multi-line string literals in the
# eDealer sources. Git's core.autocrlf restored those files as CRLF twice
# during this project, which made every one of those matches fail silently:
# the generated output came out subtly wrong rather than erroring. Pinning
# LF removes that failure mode.
* text=auto eol=lf

# ...except the creatives, which must never be touched.
*.webp binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
